.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt JOTAIN-TESTING 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm jotain-testing
.Nd ERT test suite of the configuration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The ERT suite lives under
.Pa test/ .
The
.Ql elisp-test
check loads every
.Pa *.el
file in that directory.
A new test file needs no registration.
.Pp
The suite has these main files:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa test-smoke.el
A canary that proves the runner globs
.Pa test/*.el .
.It Pa test-ui.el
Regression tests of the theme wiring.
They read
.Pa init-ui.el
as data, so the theme names cannot drift from the design-system pin.
The theme-file tests use
.Ql skip-unless
for the
.Ql jylhis-themes
package.
.It Pa test-org-babel.el
The Org Babel wiring, including the
.Ql jotain-org-babel-confirm-evaluate
trust check.
.It Pa completion-test.el
The in-buffer completion wiring.
.It Pa devenv-test.el
The
.Pa devenv.el
integration library.
.It Pa lang-eval-test.el
A drift guard for the language-evaluation registry in
.Pa etc/lang-eval/ .
.El
.Pp
The other files cover the language modules, the version-control wiring and the
review libraries.
.Sh RUNNING
Command
.Ql just test
builds the
.Ql elisp-test
flake check in the Nix sandbox, which loads every file of
.Pa test/
with
.Fl L Pa lisp
and runs it with
.Ql emacs -batch .
The check also writes a JUnit report.
The project shell has no Emacs, so the check is the way to run the suite.
Command
.Ql just check
runs every flake check, including this one.
.Pp
The sandbox has no network.
A test must not need the network, a subprocess or the devenv binary.
Use
.Ql skip-unless
for anything that needs an external tool.
.Sh CONVENTIONS
.Bl -bullet
.It
Prefix every
.Ql ert-deftest
with the module or package name.
Test names share one global namespace.
.It
Keep tests free of side effects:
use
.Ql with-temp-buffer ,
let-bound options and
.Ql cl-letf
to stub functions.
.It
Load project code with
.Fl L Pa lisp .
.El
.Pp
The
.Ql elisp-dev
skill has the full pattern reference in its file
.Pa debugging-and-testing.md .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr jotain 7
